---

<Layout
  title="Farooq Q. | Courses"
  description="Course ratings and semester reviews by Farooq Qureshi"
>
  <main>
    <article class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Here are all the courses I've taken in my degree. Assigned to each of
        them is a rating out of 10 and my recommendations for professors for
        each course.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also write course reviews for each semester. Here's <a href="/writing/f24">Fall 2024</a>, <a href="/writing/w25">Winter 2025</a>, <a href="/writing/s25">Summer 2025</a>, <a href="/writing/f25">Fall 2025</a>, and <a href="/writing/w26">Winter 2026</a>.
      </p>

      {
        courses.map((c) => (
          <p>
            {c.title}
            <br />
            {c.detail}
          </p>
        ))
      }
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
